    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Noel Kelly Auctioneers presents this truly magnificent, extended 3-bedroom home with attic conversion boasting high spec features throughout. This energy efficient and well-proportioned property enjoys all the comforts of modern day living in the ever-popular Parkside development. \r\nUpon entry you are greeted by a light filled entrance hall with storage closet, upgraded guest wc, spacious lounge, fully fitted kitchen/dining area with a large utility and dining room extension with double doors to a tastefully landscaped rear garden. On the first floor there are 3 large bedrooms with fitted wardrobes, master bedroom en-suite and a family bathroom. 8 Parkside Close also boasts an attic conversion which features two rooms that could be used as a bedroom and office space.    \r\nParkside is the perfect estate for families, close to schools, shops, cafes, Clongriffin Dart station, Dublin Airport, M1/M50 and whole host of other fantastic amenities close by."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall     \t        4.74 x 1.14\tTiled floor, wired for security alarm, recess lights, large storage\r\n\r\nGuest WC\t1.58 x 1.41\tTiled floor, dome light, wc, whb\r\n\r\nLounge\t4.60 x 3.79\tCarpet floor, blinds \r\n\r\nKitchen /Dining       4.94 x 4.93    Tiled floor, recess lights, fully fitted kitchen with tiled splashback, dishwasher, fridge freezer, built in microwave, double oven, hob, extractor, boiler, blinds\r\n\r\nDining Room Extension \t3.60 x 2.85   Decorative timber floor. Roof light, recess lights, doors to rear garden\r\n\r\nUtility Room with Alcove\t\tPlumbed for washing machine and dryer, large extra storage space\r\n\r\nStairs/Landing\t\tHot press, carpet floor \r\n\t\t\r\nMaster Bedroom\t3.58 x 3.76\tFitted wardrobes, carpet floor, blinds\r\nEnsuite\t2.49 x 1.20\tTiled floor & walls, wc, whb, walk in shower, shaving light, heated rail\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\t4.21 x 2.78\tFitted wardrobes, carpet floor, blinds \r\nBedroom 3\t4.10 x 2.11\tFitted wardrobes, carpet floor, blinds\r\n\t\t\r\nBathroom         2.93 x 1.69        Heated rail, tiled floors & walls, shaving light, walk in shower, fitted bath suite, wc, whb\r\nAttic Conversion 4.66 x 5.09\t Extra storage, 2 x velux, currently in use as office and bedroom \r\n\r\nGarden\t\tLandscaped, garden shed, fenced, artificial grass, patio area, lean-to side passage (extra weather-proof outdoor storage for bikes etc)"
      },
      {
